This package is a Dart port of the official RudderStack server-side SDK for
Node.js, `@rudderstack/rudder-sdk-node` (https://github.com/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-node),
version 3.0.3. Message construction, validation, batching and retry behaviour
follow that implementation. Its licence, which itself carries the notice of the
Segment library it derives from, is reproduced below as required.

